{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "realestate-api-v1",
    "name": "Real Estate Public API",
    "description": "Public REST endpoints for the ATMTA real-estate suite plus iframe-embeddable 2D drill plan and 3D maquette.\n\nDev server: http://egyptairodoodev.isdeg.com:8069\n\nSetup\n-----\n1. `{{base_url}}` is pre-set to the dev host above. Change for prod when ready.\n2. Set `{{db_name}}` to the target Odoo database on that host \u2014 ask the team if you don't know it.\n3. Set `{{api_key}}` to an API key (scope `real_estate_api`) issued for your integration.\n4. Set `{{website_origin}}` to the origin your iframe will load from. Must be in the server's `real_estate_api.cors.allowed_origins` and in each embed token's `allowed_origins`.\n5. Run requests top-to-bottom. The first call (`Catalog / List Projects`) fills `{{first_project_id}}` so deeper requests work out of the box. Adjust `{{project_with_2d}}` and `{{project_with_3d}}` to a project that has those assets configured.\n\nWire format\n-----------\n* `X-Odoo-Database: {{db_name}}` is injected on every request by a collection-level pre-request script. Do NOT send a `session_id` cookie alongside it \u2014 the server returns 403 on collision.\n* Catalog GETs are public \u2014 the API key is optional. Mutating calls (`Embed Tokens`, `Interests`) require `Authorization: Bearer {{api_key}}`.\n* Errors come back as `{\"error\": {\"code\": \"...\", \"message\": \"...\"}}` with the correct HTTP status. No silent fallbacks \u2014 404 on missing record, 400 on bad input, 403 on origin mismatch, 429 when rate-limited.\n\nBase URL: {{base_url}}",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://egyptairodoodev.isdeg.com:8069"
    },
    {
      "key": "db_name",
      "value": "YOUR_DB_NAME_HERE"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "YOUR_API_KEY_HERE"
    },
    {
      "key": "website_origin",
      "value": "YOUR_WEBSITE_ORIGIN_HERE"
    },
    {
      "key": "first_project_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "project_with_2d",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "project_with_3d",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "property_with_plan",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "building_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "developer_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "embed_token_2d",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "embed_token_3d",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "lead_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "partner_external_ref",
      "value": "postman:test:user:1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Inject the X-Odoo-Database header on every request so a single",
          "// Odoo instance hosting many databases routes us to the right one.",
          "const db = pm.collectionVariables.get('db_name') || '';",
          "if (db) {",
          "    pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Odoo-Database', value: db });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Tiny universal assertion: every response is JSON (or HTML for embed routes).",
          "// Stricter per-request tests are inside individual items.",
          "pm.test('status not 5xx', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.below(500));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
